2026-09-20T03:00:00+05:30
Phase: Hardening — Per-User API Scoping & Cleanup
Change:
- Removed limitation: all 14 `/api/*` route handlers now resolve the learner from the authenticated session (`session.user.id`) via new `getCurrentProfileId()` helper; demo `findFirst()` lookups eliminated.
- Rewrote `src/middleware.ts`: `getToken`-based; returns JSON 401 for `/api/*` except `/api/auth/*`; redirects unauthenticated pages to `/signin` with callbackUrl. Fixed a redirect bug where the fallthrough page branch was catching `/api/auth/*` and redirecting NextAuth endpoints to `/signin`, breaking login.
- Marked all session-dependent route handlers `export const dynamic = 'force-dynamic'` to stop Next from attempting static prerender of routes using `headers()` (silenced build-time "Dynamic server usage" noise; all API routes now render as `ƒ`).
- Deleted stray prisma probe `test-events.ts` from repo root.
- `src/app/api/gaps/analyze/route.ts`: `targetRoleId` now `roleId || profile.targetRoleId || undefined` (previously `string|null` failed the `findUnique` typed where clause and degraded type inference).
Files Modified:
- src/middleware.ts
- src/lib/auth.ts
- src/app/api/{profile,profile/analyze,agent/events,roadmap,roadmap/generate,tasks,tasks/[id],tasks/[id]/submit,gaps/analyze,projects,progress,skills,chat,demo/reset}/route.ts
- .ai/logs/development.log
- (deleted) test-events.ts
